<title>USA: Healthsource Q3 oper shr net $0.08 vs $0.21.</title>
<headline>Healthsource Q3 oper shr net $0.08 vs $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>HOOKSETT, N.H. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	$  0.08   profit	$ 0.21</p>
<p> Net	loss	    3,339   profit	15,023</p>
<p> Revs		     426,414		  328,211</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	63,984		   63,748</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper Shr profit	$  0.40   profit	$ 0.59</p>
<p> Net profit		18,661   profit	40,416</p>
<p> Revs		   1,275,626		  823,062</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	65,084		   63,870</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 and Nine months 1996 shr exclude non-recurring charge of $0.13 per share related to costs Healthsource Inc has elected to incur to enhance its provider arrangements. After charges, firm's Q3 1996 net loss $0.05 per share, and nine months 1996 shr is $0.27.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
